Scenario: Assign contact role to contact as permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts should be able to be assigned to account contact roles on accounts by permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	| Okta ID       | koroneikicontact1                        |
	And I create a contact role on koroneiki with the following values
	| Description | This is the default role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Role                  |
	| Type        | Account                               |
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code         | KORAUTO                                  |
	| Description  | Test automotive account on koroneiki     |
	| Fax Number   | 555-555-1234                             |
	| Industry     | Automotive                               |
	| Name         | Koroneiki Automotive                     |
	| Notes        | Additional account notes                 |
	| Phone Number | 555-555-5678                             |
	| Sold By      | Liferay US                               |
	| Status       | Approved                                 |
	| Tier         | Regular                                  |
	| Website      | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              |
	And I assign contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I set the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| View | true |
	And I set the permissions for the contact role "Default Account Role" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Assign Contact | true |
	And I assign the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" to the following roles as a permissioned user	
	| Default Account Role |
	Then the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Default Account Role"
	And the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Koroneiki Automotive" should have the contact role "Member"

